# manifests/base.pin -- the single BUILD+provenance base pin.
# Substrate (Debian testing netinst) sha256 + its archive date, and the
# snapshot.debian.org timestamp DERIVED from it (the snapshot that
# authorizes the most of the netinst's own package identities).  Written
# by build/refresh-substrate.sh; the provenance gate fails if the pinned
# snapshot does not authorize the substrate, or if the substrate is
# older than NCZ_SUBSTRATE_MAX_AGE_DAYS at build time.
# arch	substrate_sha256	substrate_date	snapshot	coverage_pct	source_url
